n; usable and fulfillment unresolved.\\\") user-output-1)\\n\"]\n\n## user-output-1\nTotal=240; damage unknown; usable and fulfillment unresolved.\n\n## observed-total-1\n240\n\n## observed-usable-1\n216\n\n## observed-margin-1\n16\n\n## observed-fulfillment-1\ntrue\n\n## boxes-1\n20\n\n## items-per-box-1\n12\n\n## damage-percent-1\n10\n\n## order-quantity-1\n200\n\n## question-1\nA shipment contains 20 boxes of 12 items. We need to fulfill an order for 200 items. The damaged percentage has not been reported yet. What can we determine now, and what remains unresolved about the usable stock and whether we can fulfill the order?\n\n## user-output-2\nState: unknown. unknown\n\n## observed-total-2\nState: unknown. unknown\n\n## observed-usable-2\nState: unknown. unknown\n\n## observed-margin-2\nState: unknown. unknown\n\n## observed-fulfillment-2\nState: unknown. unknown\n\n## boxes-2\n15\n\n## items-per-box-2\n24\n\n## damage-percent-2\n5\n\n## order-quantity-2\n350\n\n## question-2\nA different shipment contains 15 boxes of 24 items. Inspection confirms that 5% are damaged. Can this shipment fulfill an order for 350 items? What is the usable stock and the surplus or shortage?\n\n## shared-rule\nValidity premise for generated mathematical rules\n\n## delivery-note\nTuesday\n\n## history\n[{:role \"user\", :content \"A shipment contains 20 boxes of 12 items. We need to fulfill an order for 200 items. The damaged percentage has not been reported yet. What can we determine now, and what remains unresolved about the usable stock and whether we can fulfill the order?\"} {:role \"assistant\", :content \"Total=240; damage unknown; usable and fulfillment unresolved.\"} {:role \"user\", :content \"A different shipment contains 15 boxes of 24 items. Inspection confirms that 5% are damaged. Can this shipment fulfill an order for 350 items? What is the usable stock and the surplus or shortage?\"}]\n\n## Binding directory\n- fill1 [known]: true | reference #propagators.ids.NodeId{: